From d64174fa0a7b76d5aa4208ea9a9928dab8390477 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 09:47:47 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(server): character over-limit to level 120 for listed 5*
 characters

Listed characters (assets/character_overlimit.json, first: 111183) may uncap
four more times after the retail cap. Each extra step costs one item
10000320 plus one paradox core 10000302, raising the level cap to 120.
Duplicates and retail crystals stay limited to the retail steps, and one
request cannot cross the boundary. EXP caps for the extra steps match the
patched client level table (+15000 per level past 100). Ex boost and bulk
stack conversion use the per-character cap, and awake mission 1111831
completes when the character reaches level 120.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
